<title>FRANCE: Soccer-Leading French league.</title>
<headline>Soccer-Leading French league.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-10-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading scorers in the French first division after Saturday's matches:</p>
<p>9 - David Zitelli (Strasbourg)</p>
<p>8 - Anton Drobnjak (Bastia), Stephane Guivarc'h (Rennes), Miladin Becanovic (Lille)</p>
<p>7 - Alain Caveglia (Lyon), Leonardo (Paris SG)</p>
<p>6 - Japhet N'Doram (Nantes)</p>
<p>5 - Sonny Anderson (Monaco), Christopher Wreh (Guingamp)</p>
<p>4 - Lubomir Moravcik (Bastia), Jean-Pierre Papin (Bordeaux),</p>
<p>Mohammed Chaouch (Nice), Xavier Gravelaine (Marseille).</p>
